{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50967","headline":"题大慈寺芍药 · 段义宗","name":"题大慈寺芍药","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浮花不与衆花同，爲感高僧护法功。\n繁影夜铺方丈月，异香朝散讲筵风。\n寻真自得心源静，观色非贪眼界空。\n好是芳馨堪供养，天教生在释门中。\n（见後蜀何光远《监诫录》卷六。\n）（《知不足斎丛书》二十二集第一百七十册。\n按《全唐诗》佚句卷仅存首二句。\n此首句「浮花」，《全唐诗》作「此花」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"段义宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50967.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50967","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}